<% content_for :title, "New match cycle — WE Match" %>

<div class="page-header">
  <h1>New match cycle</h1>
</div>

<div class="card flow-callout">
  <p><strong>Usually you don’t need this.</strong> Groups with a start date get a cycle every two weeks automatically.</p>
  <p class="muted">Use this only for an extra round. Pick the group — we’ll set the dates like the automatic cycles.</p>
</div>

<div class="card form-card">
  <%= render "form", match_cycle: @match_cycle, mode: :new %>
</div>
